at":"2025-03-19T09:35:35Z"},"comments":5,"created_at":"2025-01-08T08:56:15Z","updated_at":"2025-05-18T06:01:18Z","closed_at":"2025-01-10T19:32:41Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nCurrent master as of writing (d2ada64a03d2abdb97cafe8f10623db8a2ce1d4c)\n\n\n### System information\n\nmacOS 14.6.1\n\n### Issue description\n\nAs of PR #47502, floats are always printed with a trailing `.0`. This is great for most situations, but should not happen with JSON files. JSON does not distinguish floats and ints, so the `.0` is possibly informative of the number's original type in Godot, but is not necessary for the JSON data, and may be misleading users into thinking that JSON supports floats and ints.\n\nWhen exporting a glTF from Godot, part of it may look like this:\n\n<img width=\"300\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a6787ea9-7892-4afc-80f0-fce00ef47d39\" />\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Have a Dictionary with float and int values, both whole numbers, like the MRP.\n2. Export this Dictionary to a JSON file using Godot's JSON stringify function (or export a glTF file which uses JSON too), either printing to the terminal or writing a file to disk.\n3. Notice that in master the float prints with `.0` while the int does not.\n4. Notice that in Godot 4.3 the float prints without the `.0`.\n\nNote: It is expected that when printing the Dictionary it has the `.0`, but not when using `JSON.stringify`.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[json-float-printing.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18344653/json-float-printing.zip)\n\n```gdscript\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tvar dict: Dictionary = {\n\t\t\"myfloat\": 1.0,\n\t\t\"myint\": 1,\n\t}\n\tvar text = JSON.stringify(dict, \"\\t\")\n\tprint(text)\n```","closed_by":{"login":"aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101274/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101274/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"not_planned","pinned_comment":null}